File GTAPDATA # base data #;
Set REG # regions # read elements from file GTAPDATA header "H1";
Set BLOC (blk1, blk2);
Mapping (onto) REGTOBLOC from REG to BLOC;
Coefficient (all,r,REG) PPL(r) # population #;
Read PPL from file GTAPDATA header "POP";
Variable (all,r,REG) pop(r) # population growth #;
Equation E_pop # identity # (all,r,REG) pop(r) = pop(r);
